  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><h3 data-start=\"283\" data-end=\"321\" id=\"isPasted\"><strong data-start=\"287\" data-end=\"319\">About Our Brand and Products</strong></h3><p data-start=\"322\" data-end=\"759\">At <em data-start=\"325\" data-end=\"366\">The Aesthetics Lounge and Spa Oceanside</em>, we combine medical-grade skincare treatments with luxury spa experiences to help clients look and feel their best. In addition to our in-spa services, we proudly offer a curated line of professional <strong data-start=\"567\" data-end=\"599\">beauty and skincare products</strong>, including top brands like <strong data-start=\"627\" data-end=\"645\">Osmosis Beauty, Tov Skincare&nbsp;</strong> and exclusive in-house favorites. Our mission is to deliver results-driven skincare with a touch of indulgence.</p><hr data-start=\"761\" data-end=\"764\"><h3 data-start=\"766\" data-end=\"799\"><strong data-start=\"770\" data-end=\"797\">What Makes Us Different</strong></h3><p data-start=\"800\" data-end=\"1258\">We stand apart by offering a personalized, high-end experience in a relaxing environment. Our team of licensed professionals uses advanced technology and proven skincare systems to achieve visible results. Whether it’s microneedling, facials, chemical peels, or permanent makeup — every service is performed with precision, care, and artistry. Our online store allows clients and affiliates alike to access premium beauty products trusted by professionals.</p><hr data-start=\"1260\" data-end=\"1263\"><h3 data-start=\"1265\" data-end=\"1298\"><strong data-start=\"1269\" data-end=\"1296\">How Affiliates Can Earn</strong></h3><p data-start=\"1299\" data-end=\"1583\">As a <em data-start=\"1304\" data-end=\"1335\">The Aesthetics Lounge and Spa</em> affiliate, you can earn <strong data-start=\"1360\" data-end=\"1389\">commissions on every sale</strong> made through your unique referral link. You’ll earn from both <strong data-start=\"1452\" data-end=\"1472\">service bookings</strong> and <strong data-start=\"1477\" data-end=\"1498\">product purchases</strong> made by your audience. The more you promote, the more you earn — there’s no limit!</p><hr data-start=\"1997\" data-end=\"2000\"><h3 data-start=\"2002\" data-end=\"2029\"><strong data-start=\"2006\" data-end=\"2027\">Other Information</strong></h3><ul data-start=\"2030\" data-end=\"2339\"><li data-start=\"2030\" data-end=\"2118\"><p data-start=\"2032\" data-end=\"2118\">Affiliates receive a personalized dashboard to track clicks, sales, and commissions.</p></li><li data-start=\"2119\" data-end=\"2186\"><p data-start=\"2121\" data-end=\"2186\">Commissions are paid monthly via your preferred payment method.</p></li><li data-start=\"2187\" data-end=\"2260\"><p data-start=\"2189\" data-end=\"2260\">There’s <strong data-start=\"2197\" data-end=\"2216\">no cost to join</strong> — just a passion for beauty and skincare!</p></li><li data-start=\"2261\" data-end=\"2339\"><p data-start=\"2263\" data-end=\"2339\">Open to beauty enthusiasts, influencers, professionals, and loyal clients.</p></li></ul><hr data-start=\"2341\" data-end=\"2344\"><p data-start=\"2346\" data-end=\"2465\"><strong data-start=\"2346\" data-end=\"2463\">Join our Affiliate Program today and start earning while sharing your love for beauty, confidence, and self-care.</strong></p><p data-start=\"2467\" data-end=\"2570\">✨ <em data-start=\"2469\" data-end=\"2568\">Become part of The Aesthetics Lounge and Spa Oceanside family — where beauty inspires connection.</em></p></div></div>",
